{"time": 1766227900, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1291841655", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(图片已过期?)"}
{"time": 1766227906, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1299499275", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(也行吧)"}
{"time": 1766227978, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1747656350", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=285013184]过了好一会，斑比才抬起头，她的嘴角一片殷红，在你眼中如此刺眼，嘴角勾着的笑容也让你心烦意乱，\"嗯～还差一点呢～\""}
{"time": 1766228022, "type": "recv", "message_id": "616737993", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "不想也不敢看她，只是一直看着西莉丝"}
{"time": 1766228062, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1090750197", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "西莉丝依然闭着眼睛，因为诅咒造成的刺痛似乎已经消了"}
{"time": 1766228266, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1028885459", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "等待一切彻底结束..."}
{"time": 1766228275, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1234307894", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=603735619]“你说，她现在还在么？时间错乱会不会和她有关？但我也不知道怎么才能再找到她……”"}
{"time": 1766228761, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1178042909", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“算了，之后再说吧。妃花现在应该也有吃饭的需求？”"}
{"time": 1766229691, "type": "recv", "message_id": "766649256", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1028885459]斑比没有下一步动作，似笑非笑看着你，血液勾起你的下巴，\"然后呢？\""}
{"time": 1766229777, "type": "recv", "message_id": "7601605", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1178042909]\"当然...嗯?也有一两天了吧？\"她越过椅背按压你的肩膀，\"难道我之前没吃过饭?\""}
{"time": 1766229909, "type": "recv", "message_id": "717161114", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“需求和尝尝不一样嘛……还是先去食堂吧”有些惬意地靠在轮椅上“之后再看看我们的卡小姐到底有没有帮我们疏通关系吧”"}
{"time": 1766230049, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1853005307", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=717161114]\"说起来，她既然让你用她妹妹的身份，是不是要改个名字诶?\""}
{"time": 1766230435, "type": "recv", "message_id": "779665842", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她推着你沿着小道向前，不过大部分时候都在看着旁边的风景，走走停停倒是。"}
{"time": 1766230457, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1535334644", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=766649256]\"还要继续吗？\""}
{"time": 1766230497, "type": "recv", "message_id": "275571985", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“麻烦斑比酱继续吧.....”"}
{"time": 1766230520, "type": "recv", "message_id": "564258011", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "不太懂她想干什么，但现在自己只能不断的迎合她了"}
{"time": 1766230612, "type": "recv", "message_id": "341148035", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嘛，谁规定卡珊德拉的妹妹不能是……哦不对不对，不行……确实是得换个名字”点点头“叫什么好呢“卡缇？”"}
{"time": 1766230836, "type": "recv", "message_id": "8852882", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=275571985]\"诶?\"她猛得靠近你，和你的脸连得极近，\"嗯...我可是认真在提问呢\""}
{"time": 1766230963, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1773017677", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（卡斯特（）"}
{"time": 1766231065, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1730407659", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“斑比大人说的...最后一点是什么...”看她这样有些害怕"}
{"time": 1766231658, "type": "recv", "message_id": "417380507", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=341148035]\"她会给你取什么名字?\"她眨眨眼，听完你的话继续开口，\"唔...卡缇，不错的名字呢～但是感觉...不太合你的风格?\""}
{"time": 1766231720, "type": "recv", "message_id": "209450528", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1730407659]\"当然是转化，还差一步。\"她自己的手指勾起你的脸，依旧冰凉，但是带一些温热"}
{"time": 1766231823, "type": "recv", "message_id": "989027117", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“剩下那一步是....”有点想转头，但感觉这时候不看她也会惹她生气，事到如今自己的意见其实基本也没什么用吧"}
{"time": 1766232321, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1425336081", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=417380507]“嗯……好难想”摇摇头“想名字什么的，而且音节太开放了，不适合我”"}
{"time": 1766232982, "type": "recv", "message_id": "396594133", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“辛德拉？”"}
{"time": 1766233100, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2041365193", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=989027117]\"注入我的血液，成为我的眷属。\"她的话语带着些蛊惑，\"不过...当然，也可以...\"她停住了，竖瞳看着你"}
{"time": 1766233274, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1691859998", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我来吗？.....”心里生出了一种难以言喻的感情..."}
{"time": 1766233405, "type": "recv", "message_id": "714922359", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "心里有一种疯狂的悸动..看向西莉丝姐姐的脖子...相比斑比来说，如果是自己的话，西莉丝姐姐应该会更安全一点吧“怎么做....”"}
{"time": 1766234144, "type": "recv", "message_id": "419744935", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1425336081]\"诶，也不是伊芙想吧?\"她敲敲你的肩膀，\"哦，到了呢。\""}
{"time": 1766234445, "type": "recv", "message_id": "599683713", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "面前的食堂仅从外表看上去就充斥着华丽的装潢，晶莹剔透的水晶，鲜亮的黄金只是最基本的装饰，一圈又一圈密密麻麻的符文萦绕四周，一进入食堂的范围，四周的音量就显著下降，你明明看见其他人在讲话，但是在你这里并没有听见。"}
{"time": 1766234462, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1110060871", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=396594133]（）"}
{"time": 1766234857, "type": "recv", "message_id": "562081031", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=419744935](不是说了吗)"}
{"time": 1766234889, "type": "recv", "message_id": "120310096", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你要听意见?"}
{"time": 1766235173, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1211331720", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=714922359]\"诶?我的意思明明是放过她诶，这样的话...\"她露出得逞的笑容，\"早就知道你是这样的孩子呢——\"她指着西莉丝的脖子，血管在你眼前鲜明的跳动，\"就是这里——\""}
{"time": 1766235295, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2128579784", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "还有放过的选项吗...但事已至此，按斑比的性格肯定也没有回旋的余地了，说不定自己自始至终只有这一种选择...像这样安慰着自己...抱歉了西莉丝姐姐，请原谅我"}
{"time": 1766235339, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1575470583", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "轻轻的朝着西莉丝姐姐的脖子咬去，不敢太用力"}
{"time": 1766236104, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1965648091", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1575470583]牙齿刺破皮肤，脖子的皮肤比起手臂要显得软嫩许多，但却没有熟悉的鲜血涌入你的唇间，取而代之的...你的血液在逆流到她的身上，渐渐有些脱力感"}
{"time": 1766236174, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1453300051", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=599683713]“降噪的魔法吗……感觉很适合密谋事情诶。话说，这个样子是不是能享受残疾人补贴之类的？”"}
{"time": 1766236400, "type": "recv", "message_id": "627641046", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1453300051]食堂里奇形怪状的人不在少数，大概你也不算特别，总之没什么人的目光看向你，\"哇...\"妃花看着琳琅满目的窗口，琳琅满目的食物，琳琅满目的装饰，\"感觉会很贵...\""}
{"time": 1766236459, "type": "recv", "message_id": "673930142", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "手仍然握着西莉丝的手，但心情难以描述，激动，开心，愧疚，害怕各种情绪交织在一起，血不断逆流 身子有些虚弱，头也出了不少冷汗，但依旧轻轻的咬着..."}
{"time": 1766237322, "type": "recv", "message_id": "287346999", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=627641046]“简直是皇宫级别的吧……”饶是以自己的出身也不免有些汗颜“有没有免费的小菜什么的”"}
{"time": 1766237545, "type": "recv", "message_id": "169613092", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=673930142]你能明确感知到她的变化，无论是气味，还是给你的感觉...越来越趋向于你自己，或者说...血族，同时，她开始索求你的血液"}
{"time": 1766237628, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1488010938", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "毫不客气的把自己的血分给西莉丝姐姐，只要西莉丝姐姐想要...一想到自己的血液在西莉丝姐姐体内流淌，莫名有一种很幸福的感觉"}
{"time": 1766238103, "type": "recv", "message_id": "211478962", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=287346999]当然也有，烤的很松软的面包堂而皇之地摆在每一张桌子上，此外还有一些预制的果酱，甚至，也有一些你不认识的小菜，整体呈黄紫色，看上去很软"}
{"time": 1766238515, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1251314677", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1488010938]血液流失地很快，很快你就感到了无力"}
{"time": 1766238701, "type": "recv", "message_id": "948101883", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1251314677]而她的索求似乎永无止境"}
{"time": 1766238736, "type": "recv", "message_id": "308649971", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "完全不管自己的状态...如果西莉丝姐姐想要，把自己的命给她都行..."}
{"time": 1766239025, "type": "recv", "message_id": "815260759", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那你过个d100)"}
{"time": 1766239035, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1604258970", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": ".rd100"}
{"time": 1766239035, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1604258970", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[伊恩]演奏出: 1D100=23"}
{"time": 1766239076, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1299713078", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "随时可能晕过去...不过她似乎有意地克制住了"}
{"time": 1766239337, "type": "recv", "message_id": "139766770", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "没关系的..西莉丝姐姐..想吸多少都可以...虽然想这么说，不过嘴被占住了，也只能想想了"}
{"time": 1766239595, "type": "recv", "message_id": "800684957", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你感觉到血液的流动被对方刻意停住了，她伸手搭在你的肩膀上，没有用力，轻轻推了推你"}
{"time": 1766239657, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1604802266", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "不太清楚是不是已经可以了，万一停下反而出事了呢，眼神看向斑比看看她怎么说"}
{"time": 1766239794, "type": "recv", "message_id": "402724680", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她已经不在你身边了，至少在你的视线范围内，没有找到她"}
{"time": 1766239847, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1837022826", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "只能暂时先松口了...然后环绕一下四周"}
{"time": 1766240120, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1845401913", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=211478962]“不赖……还是很给人体面的嘛”指着一张无人落座的桌子“妃花先坐下？”"}
{"time": 1766240562, "type": "recv", "message_id": "97011222", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1837022826]西莉丝的手搭在你的身上，四周寂静无人，斑比似乎真的离开了，连墙壁上的血丝都消失了，人偶跌倒在床边"}
{"time": 1766240594, "type": "recv", "message_id": "104253285", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对...不起...”趴在西莉丝身上，有些不敢看她"}
{"time": 1766240888, "type": "recv", "message_id": "534290049", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1845401913]\"嗯嗯。\"她推着你到桌边，随后就坐在一边，\"嘛，不过先坐的话怎么点餐?\""}
